{{!
    @template mod_vrroom/environment_preview

    A picture of the chosen room under an environment selector of the activity settings, with the
    room's name, credit and number of places. The AMD module mod_vrroom/environment_preview swaps it
    when another room is chosen, before saving. Without a picture a placeholder text is shown.

    Classes required for JS:
    * d-none - hides the image, the placeholder or an empty caption line

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="vrroom-envpreview" on the figure, with data-previews (JSON map key => {name, url,
      credit, places, placeholder}) and data-none (placeholder text when a choice has none)
    * data-region="image", "placeholder", "placeholdertext", "name", "credit", "places"

    Context variables required for this template:
    * uniqid - id of the figure
    * previewsjson - JSON map of every choice
    * none - placeholder text for a choice without a picture
    * name - room name (also the image's alt text)
    * url - preview image URL, or null
    * credit - credit line, or empty
    * places - "Places for N stations" line, or empty
    * placeholder - placeholder text shown when there is no url

    Example context (json):
    {
        "uniqid": "vrroom-envpreview1",
        "previewsjson": "{\"gallery-hall\":{\"name\":\"Gallery hall\",\"url\":\"https://example.com/gallery-hall.jpg\",\"credit\":\"\",\"places\":\"Places for 10 stations\",\"placeholder\":\"\"} }",
        "none": "No preview for this room.",
        "name": "Gallery hall",
        "url": "https://example.com/gallery-hall.jpg",
        "credit": "",
        "places": "Places for 10 stations",
        "placeholder": ""
    }
}}
<figure class="vrroom-envpreview mb-0" id="{{uniqid}}" data-region="vrroom-envpreview"
        data-previews="{{previewsjson}}" data-none="{{none}}">
    <img class="img-fluid rounded border{{^url}} d-none{{/url}}" data-region="image"
         {{#url}}src="{{url}}" {{/url}}alt="{{name}}" width="640" height="360">
    <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 rounded border bg-body-secondary{{#url}} d-none{{/url}}" data-region="placeholder">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-body-secondary small p-3 text-center"
             data-region="placeholdertext">{{placeholder}}</div>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="small text-body-secondary mt-1" aria-live="polite">
        <span class="fw-semibold{{^name}} d-none{{/name}}" data-region="name">{{name}}</span>
        <span class="d-block{{^credit}} d-none{{/credit}}" data-region="credit">{{credit}}</span>
        <span class="d-block{{^places}} d-none{{/places}}" data-region="places">{{places}}</span>
    </figcaption>
</figure>
